SUMMARY:Wooly Wednesday Fiber Arts Meetup
DESCRIPTION:A casual\, 3rd space meetup for fiber arts enthusiasts. Bring your current project\, and make new friends!\n\n\nThis meetup is up a flight of stairs. There is no elevator\, so with apologies\, this event is unfortunately not accessible.
